<śatarudriya vyākhyā>

(p. 4a, f.1a, 1st line)
 
īśāna(naḥ) sarvavidyānāmīśvaro nikhilātmanām|
jayatyakhaṇḍasarvajño jagadādi guruśśivaḥ|| (2nd line)
[prasāditayajuśśākhāṃ prapadye śatarudriyam|
sāramuddhṛtya rudrāṇāṃ samyagvyākhyā (*)vidhīyate]||(*)(3rd line)
bhasitakavacitānāṃ bhasmarudrākṣadātmanām|
amṛtakiraṇamauleraṃ mūle sthitānāṃ (*)pratidinam||(*) (4th line)
ata(tha) rudrapraśnaśuddhārthayā nāmamarapatinatānāmasmi dāsirudāsam|(5th line)
iha khalu| śrutismṛtī(ti)itihāsaprasiddhameva śrīrudropaniṣatsarvavedoktamatvam|| (6th line)
tathāhi| jāpālopaniṣadi tāvat| `atha hainaṃ brahmacāriṇamūcuḥ kiṃ japyenāmṛtatvam||(7th line)
brūhī’ti mokṣasādhanapraśne `sa hovāca yājñavalkyaḥ| śatarudriyeṇetyetāni ha vā(8th line)
amṛtasya nāmadheyāni etaiḥ ha vā| amṛto bhavatī’ti śatarudrīyavācyaśrīrudropaniṣadaḥ (p.4a, f.1, b1st line)
prādhānyena mokṣasādhanatvaṃ prativādyate| śataṃ rudrādevatā asyeti śatarudriyaṃ `sāsya devate’(2nd line)
tyadhikāre `śatarudrāt| ghaśche’ti sūtreṇa śatarudraśabdāddevatātveryaghapratyayasya cakāreṇa(3rd line)
chapratyayasya ca vidhānena ca śatarudriyam| śatarudriyamiti rūpadvayasya vaiyākaraṇaiḥ vyutpādanāt (4th line)
śatapadamānantyaparam| `śatamanantaṃ bhavatī’ti śruteḥ| `viśvaṃ śataṃ sahasrañca sarvamakṣaya(5th line)
vācakam’ iti| mahābhāratavacanācca|
anantāścaiva haridrāḥ pratipādyante| `sahasrāṇi(6th line)
sahasraśo ye rudrā adhibhūmyām|’
`ye cemāṃ rudrā adhibhūmyāmabhito dikṣu śrutā sahasraśaḥ’ (7th line)
ityādi śravaṇāt|
mantrapratipādyatayā teṣāṃ devatātvaṃ `mantravācyātvo devate’ti niruktavadanācca|(8th line)
yadvā rudrasya idaṃ rudrīya`vṛddhācca’| iti ca pratyayaḥ| tathā ghapratyayaśca kevalādāṃ rudra(p.5a, f.2a,1st line)
śabdātsaṃbandhārthādiṣu ghapratyayasya `yāte agne rudriyā tanuḥ| yathā tokāya’rudrīyamityādiṣu(2nd line)
darśanāt| evañca rudrīyapadaṃ rudrasaṃbandhī śrīrudropaniṣatparaṃ śataśākhāsu paṭhitaṃ śatarudriyam|(3rd line)
taduktaṃ skānde sūtasamhitāyāṃ `śataśākhāgataṃ sākṣāt śatarudriyamuttamam| tasmāt tajjapamātreṇa(4th line)
sarvapāpaiḥ pramucyata’ iti| 
bhaṭṭabhāskareṇāpyuktaṃ `ekaṃ śataṃ  yajuśśāstrāsu (5th line)
rudropaniṣadāmnāyata’ iti| ata (tha, ti) rudrasya imāni rudriyāṇi rudranāmadheyāni śatamanantā (6th line)
rudranāmadheyāni yasmin śatarudriyaṃ tadidaṃ uttamam| `etānī ha vā amṛtasya nāmadheyānī’ti uktañca| (7th line)
kūrmapurāṇe bhagavataiva `imāni me rahasyāni nāmāni śruṇatānaghe’ti| bhārate ca droṇaparvaṇi| (8th line)
śatarudrādhyāyo varṇyate| atra hi| `nāmadheyāni lokeṣu bahunyasya yathārthavat’ iti (p. 6a, f. 2b,1st line)
parameśvaranāmānaṃtyaṃ pratijñāya| `vede cāsya samāmnātaṃ śatarudrīyamuttamami’ti|
vedagataśatarudrīyaṃ tadupapādakatvena udāhṛtaḥ| (2nd line)
tena ca śatarudranāmānantyaṃ śatarudrīyapadapravṛttinimittaṃ bhavati| na ca (3rd line)
parameśvaranāmatvena naikhaṇḍukādibhiḥ ananuśiṣṭānāṃ kathaṃ tannāmatvaṃ iti vācyam| `etāni ha vā (4th line)
amṛtasya nāmadheyānī’ti sākṣādvedoktasya nikhaṇḍvanuktyā parityāgayogāt `imāni me (5th line)
hasyānī’ti kūrmapurāṇavacanena vedarahasyanāmatayā avagatatvena teṣu (6th line)
naikhaṇḍukāparigrāhasya anyathā siddhatvācca lokaprasiddhakāvyanāṭakādiprayukta(-) katipayanāmamātra(7th line)
saṅghāhiṇo hi naikhaṇḍvukāḥ| na vedarahasyeṣu vā priyante| hi naikhaṇḍukairaparigṛhītān (8th line)
etādṛśani parasahasraṃ vaidikanāmadheyāni yathā| `taditi vā etasya mahato bhūtasya nāma bhavati’ `etadvā (p. 6b, f. 3a,1st line)
apāṭhanāmadheyaṃ guhyaṃ yadā yāvā’ ityādi na hyeteṣu naikhaṇḍukāparagrahasaṃ nāmatvamapanetuṃ (2nd line)
prahavati| pratyuta vedarahasyatvameva eteṣāmupodbalayati| atha `oṃ tatsaditi brahmaṇastrividha smṛta’ iti| (3rd line)
`ātānataptā lavathā vasaṅghā’ ityādi bhārata vacanaprayogāt teṣāṃ tannāmatvamavagatyata iti cet| (4th line)
aho devānāṃ priyasya prayogaḥ śraddhāyo yaṃ vedoktamaśradda(ddha)yānaḥ kociditihāsa(5th line)
purāṇavacane na tadabhyupagacchati| asti ca tādṛśaṃ bhāratavacanam(-) 
`nāmadheyāni lokeṣu (6th line)
bahūnyasya yathārthavat|
vede cāsya samāmnātaṃ śatarudrīyamuttamami||’ti 
prāgudāhṛtaṃ (7th line)
santi ca| pratyekamapi prayogāḥ| 
yathā `harikeśaḥ tathetyuktā dīrghadarśī tathā prabhuḥ’| 
`na te giritrākhilalokapālaviriñcavaikuṇṭhasurendragaṇḍam’| (8th line)
`tato mīḍvāṃ samāmantrya’ `tato mīḍraṣṭamoditān’ (p. 7a, f. 3a 1st line)
ityādi bhāratabhāgavatavacaneṣu śrīrudrāmnātaharikeśamīḍhūṣṭamādīnāṃ prayogāt| tasmādetādṛśeṣu (2nd line)
nāmasu na naikhaṇḍukānāṃ saṃbandho'stītyāstāṃ tāvat| mokṣasādhanajapyā upaniṣada iti paśusthitiḥ|(3rd line)
sā cātra brahmacāribhiḥ vastustha(sthi)tiryadi avagatā tadā praśnā saṅgatiḥ nahyupaniṣadāṃ mokṣasādhanajapyatvāvagame (4th line)
jāte `kiṃ japyenātra tatvami’ti punaḥ| praśno ghaṭate yadi ca na avagatā tadā śatarudrīyeṇetyuttarā (5th line)
saṅgatiḥ nahyupaniṣadāṃ mokṣasādhanajapyatvaṃ vastuvṛttamanvagatya `kiṃ japya nāmṛtatatvami’ti (6th line)
praśne `śatarudrīyeṇe’tyuttaraṃ saṅgacchate| kintu upaniṣadastu tathetyeva taduttaraṃ yuktam| anyathā (7th line)
viśeṣagrahaṇaṃ śeṣapratiṣedhārthamiti nyāyena śatarudrīyātiriktānāṃ upaniṣadāṃ mokṣasādhana japyatvābhāva(8th line)
prasaṅgāt | yathākhalu ko vāsmin grāme paṇḍita iti praśne devadattaḥ paṇḍitaḥ ityukte tadvyati(p. 7b, f. 4a, 1st line)
riktānāṃ yajñadattādīnāmapaṇḍitatvaṃ bhavati| tadvattasmāditvaṃ praśnottarayossāmānādhikaraṇyaṃ (2nd line)
vaktavyam| sāmānyena upaniṣanmātraṃ mokṣasādhanajapyamiti niścitya tanmadhye kiṃ uttamaṃ japyamiti praśnaḥ (3rd line)
tathā śatarudrīyakṛtamiti| uttarañca atha eva kathaṃ śatarudrīyasya sarvopaniṣaduttamatvam iti śaṅkāyāmetānīha (4th line)
vā amṛtasya nāmadheyānīti tadupapādyate| etāni śatarudrīyāmnātāni amṛtasya nityamuktasya (5th line)
parameśvarasya nāmadheyānītyarthaḥ| astu tataḥ kiṃ tatrāha(6th line)
bhavatīha vā| avadhāraṇārthe etaireva nāmadheyairmukto bhavati tiṣṭhatve tat brahmātma(7th line)
tatvānusandhānam e tatra tāni parameśvaradivyanāmānyeva kevalaṃ japamātreṇa mokṣapradāni (8th line)
upaniṣadantare tu naiva | atassarvopaniṣaduttamatvamiti bhāvaḥ| etānīha vā ityanena śataśākhā(p.8a, f.4b 1st line)
gatatvassūcyate tena cāyamarthaḥ| pradarśito bhavati yadyapi sarvāṇyapi parameśvarasya nāmadheyāni (2nd line)
ata eva imāṃ rudrāyasthirayanvane gira iti śruteḥ| pratyakṣasannitāpitasakalaśabdarāśeḥ (3rd line)
parameśvarābhidhānatvam pratipādayati| tata evāśvalāyanena śivaṃ prastutyoktaṃ `sarvāṇīha vā (4th line)
etasya nāmadheyāni’ tathāpi| śataśākhāmnātatvena mokṣasādhanatvena ca prasiddhatayā (5th line)
mukhyatvādetāni nāmadheyānītyuktirupavarṣate| `ṣaṭtriṃśadaho vayañcādvādaśāha’ iti(6th line)
ṣaṭtriṃśadahobhissāddhyasyāpi kṛtordvādaśāhassāddhyahāni mukhyānīti dvādaśāhavya(sya) pradeśavaditi soyamarthaḥ (7th line)
sarvo'pi kūrmapurāṇe darśitam| tatra hi | vasumanaso rājarṣe brahmavaralabdhasāgṛha(-) samvatsaraśatānuṣṭhatagāya tadyupāsanaṃ yā prasannaṃ parameśvaraṃ prasṛtya idaṃ paṭhyate| `tadā prāha mahādevo (p.8a, f.5a,1st line)
rājānaṃ prītimānasaḥ| imāni me rahasyāni nāmāni śruṇu tānayeti| sarvavedeṣu gītāni saṃsāraśamanāni ca| (2nd line)
namaskuruṣva satatamebhirnāma padaiśśuciḥ|
adhyāyaṃ śatarudrīyaṃ yajuṣāṃ sāramuttamam| (3rd line)
japasvānanyacetaskoḥ ye(e)vā sattamānasaḥ| brahmacārī mitāhāro bhasmaniṣṭhasamāhitaḥ japedā(4th line)
maraṇādrudraṃ tato yāti parāṃ gatim’| atra `yajuṣāṃ sārami’ti yajusaratvenaiva (5th line)
yajurvedottamatve siddhe punaruttamapadaṃ ṛgvedottamaparam| evaṃ ca sarvottamaṃ (6th line)
śatarudriyamadhyāyaṃ japediti vidhiḥ| anena sahovācā(ca) `śatarudrīyeṇe’tyasyābhi(7th line)
prāyo darśitaḥ| atra ca kathaṃ sarvottamatvamiti ākāṃkṣāyāṃ tadupapādanāya saṃsāraśamanānīti (8th line)
viśeṣaṇam| na kevalaṃ japamātrasaṃssāramocakaṃ madīyanāmani kurumbakarambitatva(-)mātreṇa| (9th line)
sarvavedottamatvaṃ kintu tādṛśaṃ madīyanamaskārapaṭitatvenāpītyabhiprāyeṇoktam (p.9a,f.5b 1st line)
namaskuruṣva satatamebhirnāmapadaiḥ iti namaskāraghaṭhitatvaṃ nāma padātmakatata(tta)nmantrajapasya vācika(2nd line)
namaskārarūpatvāt| japaṃ kurvasatvaṃ namaskārānapi kṛtavānbhaverityarthaḥ| tathā ca kevalaṃ nāmadhepā(yā)nyeva (3rd line)
samskāra nāśakāni taiḥ namaskaropi cet| kimu vaktavyam| samsāraduḥkhamunmūlayantītyabhiprāyaḥ (4th line)
tadanenāpi `etairhatvā amṛto bhavatī’ti śrutibhāgo vyākhyātam| imānīme nā(5th line)
mānītyanena ca etānīha vā amṛtasya nāmadheyānītyaṃśo vyākhyāte| atra etā(6th line)
nītyasya pratipadamimānīti amṛtaśabdārthapratipada iti sarveṣu vedeṣu gītānyanena etānīha (7th line)
vā iti nipātārthaḥ| śataśākhāmnātatvarūpā prasiddhirdarśitaḥ rahasyānītyanena vedarahasye'rthe (8th line)
naikhaṇḍukādyaprasiddhi(ddhiḥ) kutarkānavakāśa ityuktam| anaghetyanena ca sāgravarṣaśatānuṣṭhitagāyatri(9th line)
upāsanā parikṣīṇapāpasya tava rudrādhyāye niravagraho adhikāra ityuktaṃ bhavati| (p. 9b, f. 6a,1st line)
