niyuktāya tasmai vedāṃśca dattavān| punaḥ ca jagadā(tā)mīśaḥ ātmatatvaikasaṅgraham| sarvopaniṣadāṃ sāraṃ rudrādhyāyaṃ ca dattavān| sa eṣa munibhiḥ pūrvaiḥ marīcyatripurogamaiḥ| saha devaiḥ dhṛtastebhyastaḥ ca (p.11b, f.8a1st line)
śarṣyā(riṣyā) jagrahuśśatam| eṣavaḥ paramaṃ tapaḥ| rudrādhyāyajapāt (2nd line)
