atra brahmādyā(dyāḥ) sthāvarāntā ityuktā(ktvā) yeṣāmīśa iti mantre dvipāccatuṣpāt grahaṇaṃ cetanātmakasakala(8th line)
prapañcopalakṣaṇamiti vyākhyātaṃ bhavati| yathā gavāśva mahiṣādayaḥ tat svāmibhiḥ pāśairābaddhya svavaśī(p.55a,f.51b,1st line)
kṛtya svārādhanarūpatayā tadupayogitayā vā sya(sva)kīyeṣu tattadvastusāmarthādhīneṣu karmasu viniyujyanta(2nd line)
iti brahmādisthāvarāntānāṃ paśutvaṃ parameśvarasya tat patitvaṃ cetyabhiprāyaḥ tat punaḥ śrūyate so'bravīt(3rd line)
paraṃ praṇāma ahameva paśūnāṃ adhipatiriti bhagavataḥ pāśupatyāṃ varalabdhamiti tatvajñānamohito(4th line)
lokaḥ paśupāśapatīn vivektumasamarthatayā svato nama oṃśakta iti karuṇayā svakīyaṃ (5th line)
pāśupatyaṃ paravyājena loke spaṣṭīkṛtamiti śivapurāṇeṣvevaṃ svatasi(ssi)ddhaṃ(6th line)
patitvaṃ mo yuṣmākaṃ paśutāpi ca tadetaddṛḍayāmyadya varabandhavinodanaiḥ ityādinā vyākhyāntābhiprāyaṃ (7th line)
yuktaṃ cetat saṃsārabandharūpapaśutvasya anāditayā tadbandhakatvarūpapatitva(tvaṃ) sāpyanāditva(tvaṃ) prāpya (p.55b,f.52a,1st line)
vyāparalabdhatva(-)yogāt| na hi bandhakaṃ vinā bandhassambhavatiḥ(ti) śrutismṛtyādyadghoṣitasvatasi(ssi)ddhiḥ| (2nd line)
parameśvarabhāve bhagavati pāśupatyavaraṇasya tallāha(bha)sya taṃ prati kasyacidvaradātuśca kathamapi vicārāsaha(3rd line)
tvāccaityāstāḥ| atha tṛtīyaḥ namassasphiñcarāya iti saspatibālatṛṇamucyate piñcara (4th line)
iti vi(pī)taraktasaṃkīrṇavarṇaḥ bālatṛṇavat piñcaraḥ sasphiñjaraḥ| tasmai tviṣamate (5th line)
prakāśavate pathīnāṃ pataye vaidikatāntrikamārgāṇāṃ nama ityakṣarārthaḥ(6th line)
atra tviṣīmata ityanena jñānarūpaprakāśa ucyate tena dvayaṃ śaṃkā (7th line)
nirastā bhavati| evaṃ hi sā śaṃkā kathaṃ parameśvareṇa tāntrikamārgāḥ pradarśitāḥ yā vedabāhyāsmṛtayo(8th line)
yāśca kāścātra dṛṣṭayaḥ sarvāstā niṣphalāḥ| pretya niṣṭhā teṣāṃ hi tāmasīti teṣāṃ(p.56a,f.52b,1st line)
nirmitatvāditi atrottaraṃ satyameva tantramārgāṇāṃ ninditatvam| tattu vaidikān (2nd line)
pratyeva vedabāhyānāṃ tu tāntrikamārgā evopakārakaḥ| tadetadālocasya sarvajñaparameśvareṇa(3rd line)
tatrāṇi praṇītāni yadi hyetāni na syu(syuḥ) tato vedabāhyāḥ pāpiṣṭhāsvato(4th line)
vaidikamārgāvimukhāśśreyassādhanamanyaśca śāstramajānantaḥ| sveścācāraprāvaṇyapi(5th line)
vaśāḥ| praṇaṣṭhā eva bhaveyuḥ atastāntrikamārgapravartanaḥ citamiti tadetat kūrmapurāṇe(6th line)
spaṣṭamupabramhitam| sa teṣāṃ māyājātaṃ go yatha(thā) gautamo muniḥ| kenāpi (7th line)
hetunā jñātvā śaśāpātīva ko vanaḥ bhaviṣyatrayī bāhyā mahāpātakibhissamā| iti vedabāhyatvena(8th line)
pāpiṣṭane(ṣṭena) ca gautamaśaptā(bdā)n prassyutyete(?) sarve prāpya deve śaṅkaraṃ viṣṇumavyayam|(p.56b,f.53a,1st line)
astu vadvividhaistotrairiścaṣṭā iva sevakā| ityādinā teṣāṃ śaṅkaraṃ viṣṇusannidhau|(2nd line)
prārthanāmupanyasya| tasmācaivedabāhyānāṃ rakṣaṇārthañca pāpi(pī)nām| vimohanāya(3rd line)
śāstrāṇi kariṣyāmo vṛṣadvajaḥ| evaṃ sucodito rudro mādhavena murāriṇā cakāra(4th line)
mohaśāstrāṇi keśavo'pi śiveritaḥ| kapālaṃ lāṅgulaṃ guḍaṃ śāktaṃ(5th line)
bhairaṃ pūrvapaścimaṃ pāñcamā(rā)traṃ pāśupataṃ tathānyāni sahasraśa (6th line)
iti| ve bāhyānāṃ pāpiṣṭhānārakṣaṇāya pāśupatapāñcarātrāditantra(7th line)
mārgaḥ| pravarttita ityuktaṃ vimohanāyetyasya cāyamarthaḥ asti ca pāśupatapāñcarātrāditantreṣu (8th line)
vedaviruddhapratipādanam| yathā kevalanimitteśvaravādo jīvāt patyādivarṇanam| (p.57a,f.53b,1st line)
tadviṣaye vedanindāteti tacca sarvapramāṇameva vyavastāpitaṃ hi tadaṃśe tadapramāṇyaṃ brahma(-)mīmāmsāyāṃ (2nd line)
pravarści(rti)taṃ teṣu ca vedanindāyāstadvirudhva(ddha)varṇanasya prayojanam| ye vaidikā eva syantaṃ (3rd line)
pāpavaśādvedeṣu aviśvāsaṃ kurvanti tān vimohayituṃ tān vimohayituṃ(?) taccha(cca) vimohanam (4th line)
teṣāmanugṛhādhaiva te hi vedadveṣiṇa(ṇaḥ) svatantreṣu sthitāṃ vedanindānāmupa(5th line)
śrutya bahumānyamānāḥ vedaṃ vidāhāya tāntrikamārgamanuprapaśyate| na vidhinā parameśvaraṃ (6th line)
ārādhyā tat puṇyaṣvapitavedadveṣadoṣamakrameṇa janmāntare vedaniṣṭāṃ (7th line)
pratipatyakṛtyā bhavanti| atha vaidikāsyaiva yataśśāṇḍilyasya vedaniṣṭāṃ vihāya pāñcarātrādi (8th line)
dīkṣāvidhinā viṣṇumārādhitavanto nindāpūrvakaṃ dvirāyavedamārgaṃ gamiṣyasīti bhagavatā vāsudevena (p.57b,f.54a,1st line)
varo datta iti vāsiṣṭhalaiṅge śrūyate| mattantrāśrayaṇenaiva matpūjāpi kṛtātvarthā| (2nd line)
tayā na prītavān asmitavaśāṇḍilye priyaḥ| kumārgeṇa(ṇā)pi śāṇḍilya kṛtāpūjā mama tvayā (3rd line)
ataḥ kālena mahatā vedamārgaṃ gamiṣyasīti| pāpiṣṭaviṣaye parameśvarasya mohakatvaṃ (4th line)
tadviṣaye veṣa iva tadanugrahe paryavasitatvānna doṣamāvahati| ata eva khalu (5th line)
buddhādyavatāreṣu bhagavato nārāyaṇasya vimohakatvaṃ bahuśaḥ prakhyāyate (6th line)
na hi tasya pūṣaṇaṃ bhavatīti| tadetat sarvamantro'pi mohanātha śāstrāṇi caityanenābhipretaṃ (7th line)
evamānyānyapyasminviṣaye bahūni vacanāni santi tāni sarvāṇyā(ṇya)pi asmābhiḥ pāṣaṇḍagajakesarisudaṃ(taṃ) (p.58a,f.54b,1st line)
hṛtāni tatraiva draṣṭavyāni tadevaṃ vedabāhyānāṃ rakṣaṇāya sarvajñena mahatā tāntrikamārgaḥ (2nd line)
pravarttita ityetat tviṣīmata ityanena pradarśitaṃ tadupari kāñcidvedādhikāriṇīṃ kāṃ dvedabāhyāṃśca (3rd line)
parameśvarasya vaiṣamyanaighraṇyadoṣamāśaṃkya saspiñjarāyetyanena saṃkīrṇavarṇaviśeṣa(4th line)
vācinā tathābhūta(-)traiguṇyapradhānatvarūpārthadyotakena tat parihṛtam| anādya(5th line)
vidyopacitatattat guṇakarmānusāreṇa
 tathā sṛjato na vaiṣmayādi prasaktiḥ(6th line)
puṇyaḥ| puṇyena karmaṇā pāpaḥ vāpenetyādi śruteriti bhāvaḥ|
|| atha caturthaḥ ||
`namo babhruśāyeti bibharta parameśvaramiti babhruḥ vṛṣabhaḥ| kṛvoraścetaraṇādisūtreṇa bhrastradhātoḥ| kṛvatyaye(?) (p.58b,f.55a,1st line)
dvivacane dhātoryaṇādeśe kitvāt| guṇavṛddhipratiṣedhe ca sati babhruriti rūpaniṣpattiḥ| babhrau śete (2nd line)
tiṣṭhatīti babhruśaḥ vṛṣavāhanaḥ babhruśayeti pāṭhe lakāre babhrureva babhruḥ iti vyākhyātavyam| viśeṣeṇa (3rd line)
viddhyatīti vivyādhī annānābhakṣya(-)bhojya(-)lehya(-)śoṣya(-)bāṇānāṃ padārthānāṃ svāmī tasmai nama (4th line)
ityarthaḥ| atra babhruśāyetyanena dharmarūpaṃ vṛṣamadhiṣṭhatonnama svāmītvaṃ taṃ|(5th line)
yajñāt bhavati parjanyaḥ parjanyādau sambhavaḥ| iti annasya dharmakāryatvaśravaṇāditi pradarśitaṃ(6th line)
vivyādhina ityanena ye anneṣu vividhyanti teṣāmannamiṣava iṣvati ca śruteḥ| annena iṣuṇān vidhyate'nna(7th line)
patitvamucitam| tanniyamyasyaiva tadūyatvāditi hetvantaram|

|| ata(tha) pañcamam ||
`namo harikeśāyeti (8th line)
nīlālakamūrdhyajasahito harikeśānītya yuveti yāvat upavīti yajñopavītivān| ādibrāhmaṇaḥ sātma(p.59a,f.55b,1st line)
vede virupākṣo'si dantāñjiriti prastutyatvaṃ deveṣu brāhmaṇo'si ahaṃ manuṣyeṣu brāhmaṇo vai brāhmaṇamupadhāvatītya|(2nd line)
upatvāthā(-)vāmi pravada brāhmaśruteḥ| ādibrāhmaṇamīśānamupāyāvenna cetaraṃ brahma te(3rd line)
jo'dhikarājanakṣātraṃ vaiśyasambhavam| sarveṣāmadhiko yasmāt bhagavān brāhmaśśivaḥ|(4th line)
iti parāśarasamhitavacanāt| puṣṭaśabdaśca devendrādivadaprañjaiśvaryādi(5th line)
paripūrtimadvāci| brahmādisthāvarānteṣu ca ye puṣṭāḥ| teṣāṃ svāmī puṣṭānāṃ (6th line)
pataya ityarthaḥ| tatra ādibrāhmaṇasya parameśvarasya brahmādi sarvopāsyatvāvaśyaṃ(7th line)
bhāvena svepāsakāṃsthān puṣṭidānena anugṛṇhastasya puṣṭānāṃ patitvaṃ upapannamityetat(8th line)
upavīti na ityanena pradarśitaṃ| svayaṃ puṣṭaṃ parasmai puṣṭiṃ prayacchati parameśvarasya nityayūno (p.59b,f.56a,1st line)
hendriyādi puṣṭiṃ nityasiddhebhyatilokebhyastasya tatpradatvamucitaṃ ityaucityarūpaṃ vastusāmarthyaṃ (2nd line)
harikeśe vadena vyajyate| itthaṃ pahimantraidīgādi kativa(pa)yavastvādhipatyapradarśanapūrvakamīśvaro (3rd line)
namaskṛtaṃ idānīṃ praticastvā(?)dhipatyavacanapūrvanamaskārasya śakṛtayā jagatpatitvena taṃ namaskartuṃ (4th line)
ṣaṣṭho mantraḥ|
`namo bhavasyeti bhavaḥ samsāraḥ tasya chedane hetiḥ āyudhaṃ samsāra(5th line)
vṛkṣaśchetyarthaḥ thāvarajaṅgamānāṃ lokānāṃ svāmī jagatāṃ patistasmai namaḥ| (6th line)
yavya(dya)pi paśūnāṃ pataya ityatraiva brahmādisthāvarāntasakalajagatpatitvaṃ uktaṃ tathāpi saṃsāra(7th line)
pāśabandhahetutvena taduktaṃ atra saṃsāramocakatvena ti(?) bhedaḥ| ubhayorapi (8th line)
brahmadharmatvāt tathoktameva jagatpatitva(-)mupapādayituṃ śramāvadhi dhāvananyāyena punarapi tat tadvatyādhipatyena (p.60a,f.56b,1st line)
bhagavantaṃ namaskartuṃ ārabhate| saptamādibhiḥ namo rudrāyeti rudraḥ| samsāraduḥkhadrāyakaḥ ata evāta tanmadhyena(2nd line)
dhanuṣā avati rakṣatītyātatāvī kṣetrāṇi śarīrāṇi| idaṃ śarīraṃ kaunteyakṣetramityabhidhīyate| iti smṛteḥ| teṣāṃ (3rd line)
svāmī kṣetrāṇāṃ patiḥ tasmai nama ityarthaḥ| loke hi deśādhipatī rūpasargebhyo deśavāsino (4th line)
rakṣatim| teṣā(ṣāṃ) ca svāśritān sukhaviśeṣeṇa saṃyojayati tathā kṣetrādhipatiḥ| (5th line)
parameśvaro'pi kṣetrasthitānṛkṣati| na hyanyaḥ parameśvaradrakṣako'sti yo na jātāni jīvantīti(6th line)
śrute ata eva khalvāśāsyate tayāsmān viśvataḥ svamayakṣmayā paribhujetīti(7th line)
tadetadātatā vivadenoktaṃ jantormrīyamāṇasya rudrastārakaṃ brahmavyācaṣṭe ve nāsāvamṛtī bhūtvā(8th line)
mokṣī bhavatīti śruteḥ kṣetraśabdasyāvimuktādikṣetraparatve viśeṣeṇa svārasyaṃ draṣṭavyam|

|| athāṣṭamaḥ ||(p.60b,f.57a,1st line)
namassūtāyeti jagadyantrasārathissūtaṃ īśvarassarvabhūtānāṃ hṛddeśe'rjuna(naḥ) tiṣṭhati bhrāmayan sarvabhūtāni (2nd line)
yantrārūḍā(ḍhā)ni māyayā iti| smṛteḥ hantumaśakya ityahantyaḥ araṇyānāṃ vanānāṃ patiḥ svāmi tasmai nama ityarthaḥ(3rd line)
vanasvāmitve jaganniyantṛtvaṃ hetussūtaśabdena pradarśitaḥ jaganniyato'pi tadvikāraiḥ nopahatiriti(4th line)
ahantyapadena jñāpyate|
|| atha navamaḥ||
`namo rohitāyeti lohitavarṇo rohitaḥ| sthātā(5th line)
cāsau pātā ceti sthapatiḥ| vṛṣodarādiḥ evaṃ bhūtāya vṛkṣāṇāṃ pataye svāmina ityarthaḥ|(6th line)
atrastha patiśabdena vṛkṣasvāmitve hetuḥ ucyate| vṛkṣaṣu sthitvā vṛkṣān (7th line)
pālayataḥ tat svāmitvaucintyāt rohitaśabdena vṛkṣādhiṣṭhātuḥ parameśvarasya rūpam uktaṃ bhavati|(8th line)
ye vṛkṣeṣu ta sphiñjarā nīlagrīvā vilohitā iti vakṣyate|
|| atha daśamaḥ ||
`namo mantriṇa iti vanagulmādayo(p.61a,f.57b,1st line)
atigahanavadārthāḥ teṣāṃ svāmī kakṣāṇāṃ patiḥ tasmai nama iti prathamamanvayaḥ| nanu atigahaneṣu(2nd line)
īśāvarasyādhipatyaṃ syāt duravagāhatvaṃ dityāśaṃkyāha viśineṣṭavāṇi jayati vāṇijāṃ samūhā vāṇijaḥ| yathā vaṇik (3rd line)
sarvajanapadavyavahārān paricchidya vidīdi(?) karoti tathā ayamapi sakalavastujālamiti(4th line)
nāsya kiñcitduravagāhamiti bhāvaḥ| kaimuktiṃ(kti)kanyāyena kakṣāṇāṃ patitvamupapādayati|(5th line)
mantreṇa iti mantraśabdena saptakoṭimahāmantrāḥ| tathā vedāntarasya bhūtaṃ upaniṣadaḥ sarva(6th line)
guptavādāṃ cābhidhīyante teṣāṃ svāmī mantrī dhanasvāmī dhanītivat na hi dhanasambandhamātreṇa (7th line)
dhanavoḍhāraṃ dhanīti vyavaharanti tathā vidheṣvapi gahaneṣu yasya svāmītvaṃ īśānassarvavidyānāmiti śruteḥ|(8th line)
tasya kimu vaktavyaṃ kakṣāṇāṃ patitvamiti bhāvaḥ|

|| athaikādaśaḥ ||
namo bhuvantaya iti bhuvaṃ tanotīti bhuvantiḥ(p.61b,f.58a,1st line)
tasmai vārivaskṛtāya varivaḥ paricaryā asya karttāro parivaskṛtaḥ bhaktāsteṣu tiṣṭhatīti vārivaskṛtaḥ sarvagatasyāpi(2nd line)
parameśvarasya bhakteṣu sānnidhyavaśādiyu(?)muktiḥ| atha eva khalu yathā yogni samāveśānā yo(3rd line)
bhavati kevalaṃ tathaiva mama syānnidhyānna te kevalamānuṣāḥ| śivasya paripūrṇasya kiṃ nāma kriyate (4th line)
naraiḥ| yat kṛtaṃ śivabhaktānāṃ tacchivasya kṛtaṃ bhavet| akāyo bhaktakāyasyākadītyādi (5th line)
purāṇavacanāni śrūyate| vṛṣadhīnāṃ vrīhyādīnāṃ pati(tiḥ) svāmī tasmai nama ityarthaḥ| atra(6th line)
bhavantaya ityanena oṣadhisvāmitvaheturucyate bhūvalayavṛṣṭatayā tat svāminaḥ parameśvarasya(7th line)
bhūbhakarauṣadhisvāmitvasyāvitata eva prāptaiḥ vārivaskṛtāyetyanena ca bhaktakāyasthatvoktyā nāhaṃ (8th line)
tayā damiyajanānahavirvitānecyo tat ghṛtaplutamadan hutabhuṅmukhena| yadbrahmaṇasya (p.62a,f.58b,1st line)
mukhataścarato nu vyāsaṃ tuṣṭasya mayyavahitaiḥ nijakarmapākaiḥ iti bhāgavatoktaṃ bhaktamukhena (2nd line)
bhagavato bhoktṛtvamāviṣkṛtam| tena ca oṣadhiphalabhoktṛtvenāpi parameśvasya auṣadhisvāmitvaṃ tat bhoktṛstat(3rd line)
svāmitvādityuktaṃ bhavati| evaṃ parameśvarabhojanarūpatvāpratyopāsakaiḥ kṛtameva bhojanaṃ (4th line)
na anyaiḥ kṛtamiti śrutismṛtyādibhirātmāyate yathā antaricchaṃtitaṃ jane rudraṃ paro manīṣayā (5th line)
gṛhṇanti| jihvayānasam| kevalāgho bhavati kevalādi ityādi śru(śru)yataḥ antaricchanti (6th line)
yo rudraṃ sadā vandyaṃ manīṣayā gṛhṇanti jihvayā so'nnaṃ rasapūrṇāmṛtodakam| (7th line)
antarṇecchanti yo rudraṃ bhavānyā sahitaṃ bhavaṃ purīṣameva dhṛhṇantī jihvayā te na samśayaḥ| ityādīni (8th line)
parāśarapurāṇavacanāni ceti|

|| athadvādaśaḥ ||
nama ucchairghoyeti| yuddhādiṣu ucchairu(p.61b,f.59a,1st line)
cchṛto ghoṣo yasya ucchairghoṣastasmai āśṛntayate vairiṇāṃ rodayitretanāśakāyeti (2nd line)
yāvat pattīnāṃ padatīnāṃ svāmine nama ityarthaḥ| atra pattīnāṃ pataya ityanena padādisāpekṣamīśvarasya(3rd line)
śauryamiti| prāptaitannivāraṇāya svayameva śatrunāśane sāmarthyadarśayitumākrantayata(4th line)
ityuktaṃ tathā ca āyudhaparivārādikamalaṃkāramātraṃ svayaṃ śatrunāśane'pi na yuddhātyapekṣā(5th line)
kintu humkāramātreṇa taditi darśayitumucchairghoṣāyetyuktaṃ (6th line)
tathā ca āyudhaparivārādikamalaṃkāramātraṃ huṃkāreṇāpi hāsavīkṣaṇa(7th line)
nakhādibhiḥ ca tripuramanmatha yamādīnān nāśitavataḥ tadapekṣā virahāditi bhāvaḥ|
|| atha trayodaśaḥ ||(8th line)
 
nama kṛtsnavītāyeti kṛtsnañjagatvītamadhiṣṭhānatayāntaryāmitayā ca vyāptā yena kṛtsnavītaḥ tasmai(p.63a,f.59b,1st line)
dhāvate bhaktānrakṣituṃ pṛṣṭhato'nuprajatevat saṃgauriśodhāvantamanudhāvanti iti vacanāt satvanāṃ (2nd line)
svātvikānāṃ pataye svāmine namaḥ| atra satvanāṃ patitve dhāvata ityanena heturuktaḥ govatsanyāyena pṛṣṭhato (3rd line)
vrajya sātvikānrukṣatastat svāmityaucityāt| kṛtsnavītāyeti anena tadeva dhāvanamupapādyate| sarvavyāpinaḥ(4th line)
savyato bhaktānānuyātuṃ śakyata iti idameva khalu kṛtsnatvena bhagavatassarvato(5th line)
rakṣakatvaṃ vācasaneyināṃ gṛhye śrūyate| kavapravekṣyaṃ nanu mantrayate| `namo(6th line)
