iti svātmārāmasya bhagavataḥ samīhitamandhānaṃ viṣayavaikṛṣṇyaspuṭīkaraṇābhiprāyamajānānāḥ (5th line)
dehātmavādinaḥ durbhagāḥ abhāgyāḥ duṣṭabhagajanyāḥ saṃkarayonijā iti yāvat(6th line)
