mahimnastave'pi udāhṛtam mahokṣaḥ khaṭvāṅgaṃ paraśurajinaṃ bhasmaphaṇinaḥ kapālañcetīyattavavaradatantropakāraṇam|(8th line)
surāstāṃstāmṛddhi dadhati bhavat| bhūpraṇihitāṃ na hi svātmānyāmaṃ viṣayamṛga(p.96b,f.93a,1st line)
