icchannamaskṛtya prārthayate yāsta iti| yāḥ sahasrahetaya anantānyāyudhāni santi tāḥ sarvā asmattaḥ anyaṃ (4th line)
pāpaṃ nivapantu nāśayantu na tu asmānityarthaḥ| atha mantrasya pulastya ṛṣiḥ| tṛṣṭup chandaḥ|(5th line)
śambhurdevatā| 
