bhagavatā sthāpitāḥ nikhilabrahmāṇḍamaṇḍalādhiṣṭhākāraḥ| niratiśayamahimamahāsamudrāḥ|(5th line)
rudrāya eko rudrā ucyate asaṅkhyā tāḥ sahasrāṇi upabhṛṃhitāśca mahābhārate|(6th line)
sadevassarvabhūtānāṃ mahādevaḥ sanātanaḥ| asaṅkhyākā sahasrāṇi rudrāṇāṃ (7th line)
sthānamavyayam| śaivapurāṇeṣu ca | ya eko rudra ityuktaḥ sa viśvamadhiṣṭhatīti| asaṅkhyā tā sahasrāṇi(8th line)
rudro bhūtvā khila jagat iti| tathā nityāmuktāni rūpamāni dvandvāni rūpaplavāḥ| (p.98b,f.95a,1st line)
saśaktayaḥ sānucārāḥ sarvalokanamaskṛtvā tāḥ| 
