prabhoḥ tasya pāriṣadā divyanānārūpā(pa)dharāḥ prabhoḥ|
vāmanā jaṭilā muṇḍā kambugrīvā mahodarāḥ||(5th line)
śūlahastā(stāḥ) khaḍgahastāḥ sarvocchritakirīṭinaḥ|
hantāro dviṣatāṃ syainyaṃ prasahyāsahyavikramāḥ||(6th line)
kāmakarāssiddhāstrailokyasya īśvarāḥ|
yai(ai)rātmabhūtaiḥ (*)bhagavān pāṣkyā(?) ca maheśvarāḥ||(*)(7th line)
sahabhūtagaṇaiḥ bhuṅkte bhūtabhavyabhavatprabhūḥ| 
(8th line)
atra saumyāghorāstathā miśrā ityanena aghorebhyo'tha ghorebhyaḥ sarvebhyassarvaśarvebhyo namaste (p.99a,f.95b,1st line)
astu rudrarūpebhya iti| uktā rudrānte evaṃ sāmavedepi devavratākhyai(-) sātniyadiviṣa(2nd line)
ityādinā| tattat lokasthitā(tāḥ) rudrā(drāḥ) pratipāditāḥ śaivapurāṇe copabramhitāḥ| (3rd line)
te hi sākṣāt diviṣadantarikṣasadastathā prathaviṣadaḥ darśitāḥ| teṣāñca nigrahānugrahā(4th line)
tmakakatvarūpaṃ ghoratvāghoratvarūpañca laiṅge pratipāditam| tatra hi smaraṇādeva(5th line)
rudrasya prāptaḥ te gaṇeśvarāḥ| asaṅkhyātāḥ mahātmāna ityupakramya uktaṃ (6th line)
