kimarthaṃ ca smṛtā deva ātmā vayamahāprabho|
kiṃ sāgarān śoṣayāmo yamaṃ vā hānma kiṃkaraiḥ||(8th line)
hanma mṛtyuṃ utāmṛtyuvivasvantaṃ tu padmajam|
badhvendusahadevaiśca sahaviṣṇuṃ sanātanam|| (p.99b,f.96a,1st line)
ārādhayāmo'tha saṅkruddhā daityāṃśca sahadānavaiḥ|
kasyādyavyāsanaṃ ghoraṃ (*)kariṣyāmastavājñayā||(*) (2nd line)
kasya vādyotsavaṃ deva sarvakāmasamanvitam|
tasya pariṣadā divyā nānārūpadharā iti|| (3rd line)
bhāratavacanena divyāgaṇā bahurūpā purāṇā iti| śrutyuktarudrāḥ pradṛśyante evaṃ (4th line)
