iti tena tadadhiṣṭhātṝ(tṛ)ṇāṃ rudrāṇāṃ mahatvātiśayo'bhivyajyate| etat mantrāmārabhya (2nd line)
navamānteṣu mantreṣu teṣāṃ sahasrayojana iti etadanuṣaṅgataḥ tadanuṣaṅga(3rd line)
dyotanāyaiva daśamamantre teṣāṃ ityādi punaḥ paṭhitam|
atha tṛtīyaḥ|
nīlagrīvā iti kālakūṭāgrasanādupari(4th line)
