atha daśamaḥ|
ya etāvanta iti sahasrāṇi sahasraśa (3rd line)
ityārabhyā yā vanto amī rudrāḥ etāvantaśca ito'pi bhūyāmsaḥ bahutarāḥ iyaktāmatītva(-)vartamānāḥ (4th line)
ye rudrāḥ diśo vitasthire sarvādiśo vyāpyasthitāḥ teṣāṃ sahasrayojaneva(5th line)
tanvāni tanmasi| atra ṛṣyādikaṃ pūrvavat| `namo rudrebhyo ye pṛthivyām’ (6th line)
ityādibhiḥ mantraiḥ| pṛthivyantarikṣadyulokasthitān(t) mudrā namaskṛtya svasya sukhaṃ dveṣiṇāṃ (7th line)
duḥkhañca prārthyate| atra ca itthaṃ mantratriya(traya)vibhāgaḥ| `namo rudrebhyā ye pṛthivyāmeṣām annamiṣavastebhyā (8th line)
daśa prācirdaśa ityeko mantraḥ| `namo rudrebhyo yentarikṣe yeṣāṃ (p.103a,f.99b,1st line)
vāta iṣavastebhyo(+?) dadhāmīti dvitīyo mantraḥ| `namo rudrebhyo ye divi yeṣāṃ varṣamiṣavastebhyo (2nd line)
dadhāmīti tṛtīyam| atra prathamasyāyamarthaḥ| `namo rudrebhyā astu ye pṛthivyāṃ vattanteṣāṃ ca (3rd line)
annamiṣavaḥ| iṣusthānīyaṃ hi sāyāyanaṃ apathyānna bhakṣaṇamiti| mātrāśanaṃ ca kārayitvā tena(4th line)
rogānutpādya kāṃścit bādhante| kāścit annavighaṭanena kṣudhāṃ(5th line)
utpādya pīḍayanti kāṃścit annārthaṃ cauryādikaṃ kārayitvā vayādikaṃ prāpayanti|(6th line)
evaṃ pāpiṣṭhahiṃsāyāmannaṃ nimittamiti| tadeva yeṣāmiṣavastebhyo rudrebhyo (7th line)
daśaprāciḥ prāṅmukhāñjalirūpāṅgulīḥ karomi| prāṅmukhatvena añjalikaraṇaiḥ daśāṅgulyaḥ(8th line)
prāgagrā bhavanti| evaṃ dakṣiṇādyūrdhvānteṣu draṣṭavyāḥ īdṛśāñjalirūpāṅgulyupalakṣitāṃ(p.103b,f.100a,1st line)
namaskārān karomītyarthaḥ| anena kāyikanamaskārodaśītaḥ tebhyo nama iti mānasaḥ| (2nd line)
mantrasyādau yo namaskāraḥ sa vācikaḥ evaṃ trikaraṇyā namaskurvāṇā vayaṃ yaṃ dviṣmaḥ(3rd line)
yaśca no asmān dveṣṭi taṃ asmatpāpa, tatphala, tadupakaraṇarūpaṃ dveṣiṇam| (4th line)
he rudrāḥ vo yuṣmākaṃ jambhe viritāsye dayāmi tat bhakṣayatetyarthaḥ| (5th line)
evaṃ dvitīya tṛtīyayoḥ api yojanīyam| ye antarikṣe rudrā vattante eṣāñca vāta iṣavaḥ (6th line)
bāṇāḥ vāyuvikāraprayuktavividharogāt pādanena tīvrataravāyunodanābhiśca (7th line)
pāpino hiṃsantītyarthaḥ| ye divi rudrā vartante| ye varṣamiṣavaḥ ativṛṣṭyanāvṛṣṭyādibhiḥ hiṃsantītyarthaḥ|(8th line)
śeṣaṃ pūrvavat iti sarvaṃ ramaṇīyam atra `namo rudrebhyo’ ityādisamāpyantaṃ yajutayameko mantraḥ| (p.104a,f.100,1st line)
atra devāṛṣiśca rudra eva dhyānaṃ sahasraśa ityatra utta(kta)meva grāhyam|(2nd line)
annasamṛddhi pradoyamantraḥ| puraścaraṇādiprakāraḥ kṛtyotpādanajātismaratvādiphalabhadāśca (3rd line)
rudrakalpakādiṣu dṛṣṭavyāḥ prapañcitāḥ| samāpta śrī rudrādhyāpraśnaḥ| [iti paramahaṃsa(4th line)
paravrājakasārvabhauma(-)śrīmat(-)advaitavidyāpratiṣṭhāpanābhinavaśaṅkarabhagavadbhiḥ (5th line)
kṛtaṃ śrī rudrabhāṣyaṃ sampūrṇam]| om sumīnākṣisundareśābhyāṃ namaḥ|(6th line)
om śivārpaṇamastu śrī gurubhyo namaḥ| hariḥ om| śubhamastu| mahāgaṇapatisakā(hā)yam| śivāya namaḥ||

